WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.725
Step 1.6 is the smoke test.

2
00:00:02.725 --> 00:00:06.348
The synthetic app signs in
twice through a GitHub workflow,

3
00:00:06.348 --> 00:00:09.750
once from outside the egress
range and once from inside.

4
00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:12.938
Both succeed, because the
policies are report-only.

5
00:00:12.938 --> 00:00:17.863
After fifteen minutes, so the sign-ins
reach the log, the smoke test runs.

6
00:00:17.863 --> 00:00:23.663
Step 1.7 hashes the evidence folder, which
says no-go until the rollback is done.

7
00:00:23.663 --> 00:00:28.963
Step 1.8 rehearses that rollback,
which disables and never deletes.

8
00:00:28.963 --> 00:00:31.685
Then you deploy again,
and the second smoke test

9
00:00:31.685 --> 00:00:34.750
becomes the evidence
production's preflight needs.
